			"notes": "### 🎉 First public release!\n \nModrinth Direct lets you search and install Fabric mods from [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com)\nwithout ever opening a browser. Just click **Mods** on the title screen, search, and install.\n \n#### What's included\n \n- In-game Modrinth search browser\n- One-click mod installation directly into your `mods/` folder\n- Automatic required-dependency resolution\n- Installed mods tracking tab\n- In-game toast notifications for download status\n- WebP mod icon support\n \n---\n \n### ⚠️ Required Dependencies\n \nYou **must** install all of the following before using this mod:\n \n| Mod | Required Version | Download |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Fabric Loader** | `>= 0.19.2` | [fabricmc.net](https://fabricmc.net/use/installer/) |\n| **Fabric API** | any | [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api) |\n| **Fabric Language Kotlin** | any | [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-language-kotlin) |\n| **oωo-lib** | `>= 0.13.0` | [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/owo-lib) |\n| **ModMenu** | `>= 17.0.0` | [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) |\n \n> **Java 21+** is required. Make sure your Java installation is up to date.\n \n---\n \n### 📦 How to install\n \n1. Install all dependencies above into your `mods/` folder.\n2. Drop `.jar` file into the same `mods/` folder.\n3. Launch Minecraft.\n4. Click **Mods** on the title screen — you're in!\n \n> Mods installed through the browser will activate after a game restart."
		}
